</div></div></header>
<section class="intro-section" id="story"><div class="container text-center intro-content"><p class="small-heading">WELCOME TO YOUR MEMORY KEEPSAKE</p><h2 class="section-title">A little space for your <em>big moments.</em></h2><p class="section-copy">Life moves quickly. MemoryLane gives you a thoughtful place to save the people, places, celebrations and everyday moments you never want to lose.</p><div class="divider-flourish">— ❧ —</div></div></section>
<section class="features-section"><div class="container"><div class="text-center section-heading"><p class="small-heading">MAKE IT YOURS</p><h2 class="section-title">Your memories, beautifully gathered</h2></div><div class="row g-4">
<div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature-paper"><span class="feature-symbol">✎</span><h3>Write the Story</h3><p>Save a memory with its title, date, place, category and the little details that make it special.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature-paper"><span class="feature-symbol">▧</span><h3>Keep the Photos</h3><p>Add photographs to bring your favourite experiences back to life whenever you revisit them.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature-paper"><span class="feature-symbol">♡</span><h3>Revisit Your Moments</h3><p>Keep your saved stories together and revisit meaningful moments whenever you like.</p></div></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="quote-section"><div class="container text-center"><div class="quote-mark">“</div><p class="quote-text">We do not remember days, we remember moments.</p><p class="quote-credit">— A place for your moments</p><a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register" class="btn btn-terracotta mt-3">Begin Your Collection</a></div></section>
